{"1490340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We Are OFK", "steam_appid": 1490340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2120200, 2120190], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the co-designer of Hyper Light Drifter,<br>We Are OFK is a behind-the-music comedy set in the creative heart of Los Angeles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a band in this dreamy, musical journey from indiepop band <strong><i>OFK</i></strong>. Cry, skate, date, and run for your life in 5 interactive music videos, across a heartfelt story of what you risk to chase your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/476125d9210b56b4ce10d0fb19c32863.poster.avif?t=1785793037\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/476125d9210b56b4ce10d0fb19c32863.webm?t=1785793037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/476125d9210b56b4ce10d0fb19c32863.mp4?t=1785793037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Itsumi Saito, hustling pianist who just moved Downtown and broke up with her long-term girlfriend to lean into her dream of making it in music. But juggling practice, friends, a brutal commute to the west side, and a full-time job... Itsu is struggling to establish herself in the cutthroat music scene of LA. When she talks her way into a shmoozy Hollywood party and makes friends with a rising music producer, she sees a chance to bring her dreams a little closer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Are OFK is an interactive tv show of arguing over lyrics, sending sad texts, and playing Interactive Music Videos, including OFK’s debut single <i><strong>“Follow/Unfollow”</strong></i> and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending narrative, rhythm gameplay, comedy and drama, OFK explores what you risk to chase your dreams, and how it changes you.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as all 4 band members across 5 episodes, featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Interactive Music Videos: with debut tracks performed by OFK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-voiced interactive dialogue from an all-star cast </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional texting, thirst texting, meme texting, emoji spamming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Los Angeles locations, and a one-of-a-kind boba spot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/73f9756be3051282d2b3feddc91d1c9e.avif?t=1785793037\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring an all-star cast from across entertainment</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>songs written &amp; produced by</i> <strong>The Naked and Famous members Luna Shadows &amp; Thomas Powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ally Maki</strong> (<i>Toy Story 4, Dear White People</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fiona Rene</strong> (CBS's <i>Tracker</i>, <i>I Know What You Did Last Summer</i>)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Syhaya Aviel</strong> (<i>Vinyl, The Circle</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erika Ishii</strong> (<i>Ghost of Yotei</i>, <i>Apex Legends</i>, <i>Deathloop</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teddy Dief</strong> (<i>Hyper Light Drifter</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deedee Magno Hall</strong> (<i>Steven Universe</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greg Chun</strong> (<i>Squid Game, Demon Slayer, Super Smash Bros Ultimate</i>)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuri Lowenthal</strong> (<i>Marvel’s Spider-Man, Bugsnax</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sara Amini</strong> (<i>Ratchet &amp; Clank: Rift Apart, The Twilight Zone</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kimberly D Brooks</strong> (<i>South Park</i>, <i>Psychonauts 2</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaiji Tang</strong> (<i>Jujutsu Kaisen, Yakuza: Like a Dragon</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miguel Caballero</strong> (<i>Killer 7</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Krizia Bajos</strong> (<i>Far Cry 6, Gotham Knights</i>) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/433f6e1323d9d61b8d087842fc531021.avif?t=1785793037\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the co-designer of Hyper Light Drifter,<br>We Are OFK is a behind-the-music comedy set in the creative heart of Los Angeles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a band in this dreamy, musical journey from indiepop band <strong><i>OFK</i></strong>. Cry, skate, date, and run for your life in 5 interactive music videos, across a heartfelt story of what you risk to chase your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/476125d9210b56b4ce10d0fb19c32863.poster.avif?t=1785793037\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/476125d9210b56b4ce10d0fb19c32863.webm?t=1785793037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/476125d9210b56b4ce10d0fb19c32863.mp4?t=1785793037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Itsumi Saito, hustling pianist who just moved Downtown and broke up with her long-term girlfriend to lean into her dream of making it in music. But juggling practice, friends, a brutal commute to the west side, and a full-time job... Itsu is struggling to establish herself in the cutthroat music scene of LA. When she talks her way into a shmoozy Hollywood party and makes friends with a rising music producer, she sees a chance to bring her dreams a little closer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Are OFK is an interactive tv show of arguing over lyrics, sending sad texts, and playing Interactive Music Videos, including OFK’s debut single <i><strong>“Follow/Unfollow”</strong></i> and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending narrative, rhythm gameplay, comedy and drama, OFK explores what you risk to chase your dreams, and how it changes you.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as all 4 band members across 5 episodes, featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Interactive Music Videos: with debut tracks performed by OFK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-voiced interactive dialogue from an all-star cast </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional texting, thirst texting, meme texting, emoji spamming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Los Angeles locations, and a one-of-a-kind boba spot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/73f9756be3051282d2b3feddc91d1c9e.avif?t=1785793037\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring an all-star cast from across entertainment</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>songs written &amp; produced by</i> <strong>The Naked and Famous members Luna Shadows &amp; Thomas Powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ally Maki</strong> (<i>Toy Story 4, Dear White People</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fiona Rene</strong> (CBS's <i>Tracker</i>, <i>I Know What You Did Last Summer</i>)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Syhaya Aviel</strong> (<i>Vinyl, The Circle</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erika Ishii</strong> (<i>Ghost of Yotei</i>, <i>Apex Legends</i>, <i>Deathloop</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teddy Dief</strong> (<i>Hyper Light Drifter</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deedee Magno Hall</strong> (<i>Steven Universe</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greg Chun</strong> (<i>Squid Game, Demon Slayer, Super Smash Bros Ultimate</i>)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yuri Lowenthal</strong> (<i>Marvel’s Spider-Man, Bugsnax</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sara Amini</strong> (<i>Ratchet &amp; Clank: Rift Apart, The Twilight Zone</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kimberly D Brooks</strong> (<i>South Park</i>, <i>Psychonauts 2</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaiji Tang</strong> (<i>Jujutsu Kaisen, Yakuza: Like a Dragon</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miguel Caballero</strong> (<i>Killer 7</i>) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Krizia Bajos</strong> (<i>Far Cry 6, Gotham Knights</i>) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/extras/433f6e1323d9d61b8d087842fc531021.avif?t=1785793037\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Start a virtual indie band in this behind-the-music comedy. Date, dance, skate, and run for your life across 5 episodes and interactive music videos, in a heartfelt story of what you risk to chase your dreams. All episodes out now!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It’s difficult to stress just how much OFK accomplishes. A story of life, love and friendship that never fails to find a glimmer of joy in the bleakest aspects of the human condition. Relentlessly charming and profoundly impactful, OFK is this year’s anthem for the summer that will leave fans breathlessly chanting for an encore.”<br>10/10 – NME<br><br>“A compelling and stylish masterclass... It’s beautiful, fulfilling and a thrilling exploration of identity and creativity, one that has stuck itself to my heart the moment the final episode’s credits rolled.”<br>9/10 – Gayming Mag<br><br>“gripped me by the heart with its gut-wrenching themes about the creative process and its striking pastel visuals. Honestly, yall, OFK left me in a teary-eyed daze”<br>Kotaku<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/ce2f260dc84cf651de2de8734982a9f071cb76ff/header.jpg?t=1785793037", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/e2128a5c715bff15a1ee02f060a1f27bc5e54a04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785793037", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490340/e2128a5c715bff15a1ee02f060a1f27bc5e54a04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785793037", "website": "http://ofk.cool", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 14 GB available space</li></ul>"